# The keys of a play of Chapter 1 from the chapter select, for alpharune-mac
# --script. Each line is "FRAME KEY [FRAMES]", or "+N KEY" for N frames
# after the line before it.
# The opening: the text goes on with Z.
# The questions of the vessel: the first answer of each.
# The name of the vessel: A, then END.
# The rest of the opening, to the room of Kris.
# The room of Kris, the house, the school, Noelle ("Yes. Ask."), Susie, the
# closet, the fall, the save point, the eye puzzle (switches 3 and 2), the
# dust pile, the chase (run right with X), the slide, Castle Town, the
# legend ("Listen"), Lancer, Ralsei, the tutorial, the door, and the Field.
# The "debug set" lines give Kris and Ralsei 900 HP for the battles.
# Then: the tile puzzle (rounds by the clock), the maze, and Hathy.
# Then: puzzle 2 (Susie at plot 37, then the three rounds for plot 38), and the door to the shop.
# Then: the shop room (right door), Lancer and a battle in field 3.
# Then: the box puzzle. Both boxes go onto the switches (plot 50).
# Then: field4, and the Great Board rooms checkers4 (a timed walk past the lit tiles) and checkers2.
# Then: checkers6 and checkers1 (timed walks), the Lancer scene in checkers3.
# Then: checkers5, checkers7, and K. ROUND. Kris and Ralsei bow (Deep Bow), Susie defends. The route sets the HP and the attack of the party.
# Then: the Forest. The two suits puzzles (spade, diamond, spade, swap; and spade, diamond, swap, spade, swap).
# Then: the Clover puzzle (diamond, swap, spade, diamond makes 4, 1, 2), and the bake sale.
# Then: forest area4 and the dancers room (the route fills the HP after the bullets of the dancers).
# Then: the Thrash Machine (LASER, PLAIN, SNEAK).
# Then: the Starwalker room, and area5 (the sign at 780,160 opens the trees).
# Then: the relax room and the maze. Each round takes the side of proper_choice (Lancer stands on the other side).
# Then: the Susie scene in the maze, and maze 2 by proper_choice.
# Then: the fight with Susie and Lancer, and the Thrash Machine scene (plot 130).
# Then: the walk after the Thrash Machine to the castle view.
# Then: the two chases with Lancer, to the front of Card Castle.
# Then: the prison. Kris checks three things and talks to Ralsei; then Susie solves the suits (spade, diamond, swap, spade).
# Then: the prison escape, the guard battle, and the room with Lancer.
# Then: the escape, and Susie against Lancer. The route sets the attack back to 10, 14, and 8 first, because Susie must not defeat Lancer in seven turns.
# Then: the elevator to Card Castle 1F (press the panel once, then leave at the bottom).
# Then: Card Castle 1F (the Rudinn room, then the top middle door) to 2F.
# Then: 2F, and the first Rouxls puzzle (one push to the left).
# Then: 2F to 3F through door C (door C goes two rooms up).
# Then: 3F (the Hathy room) to 4F.
# Then: the second Rouxls puzzle (two pushes to the left).
# Then: 4F, the Clover room, and door E to 5F.
# Then: 5F (the Lancer room) and door C to 6F.
# Then: 6F. Rouxls calls K. ROUND again; Kris uses Throw (angle 12 to 14, power 22) until the crown comes off.
# Then: the throne room and the roof, to the King.
# Then: the King. FIGHT until he surrenders, then the scene.
# Then: the fountain, and back to the school in the Light World (plot 250).
